    MOVE COBOL-VERIFY-ASYNC-TASK-NEW-RESULT TO COBOL-VERIFY-ASYNC-TASK-WAIT-SELF COBOL-VERIFY-ASYNC-TASK-RESULT-SELF
        COBOL-VERIFY-ASYNC-TASK-READY-SELF COBOL-VERIFY-ASYNC-TASK-CANCEL-SELF COBOL-VERIFY-ASYNC-TASK-CLOSE-SELF.

*> Leaves a 60s worker running; the exit cleanup must stop it quickly.
LEAVE-WORKER.
    MOVE "exit" TO T-TEST-LABEL
    MOVE 1 TO COBOL-VERIFY-ASYNC-TASK-NEW-VALUE
    MOVE 60000 TO COBOL-VERIFY-ASYNC-TASK-NEW-DELAY-MS
    CALL "cobol_verify_async_task_new" USING COBOL-VERIFY-ASYNC-TASK-NEW COBOL-DEMO-STATUS
    PERFORM EXPECT-OK
    CALL "cobol_verify_async_task_live" USING COBOL-VERIFY-ASYNC-TASK-LIVE COBOL-DEMO-STATUS
    IF COBOL-VERIFY-ASYNC-TASK-LIVE-RESULT NOT = 1 PERFORM FAILED END-IF.
